OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed after #80m of cocaine
OL,4,Asmuggled in lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA third member of a cocaine smuggling
OL,7,Fgang has been jailed for 20 years after
OL,8,Fofficers tracked 18 holdalls of the
OL,9,Fdrug, valued at about #80m, in a lorry.
OL,11,FPolice were called to a lay-by on
OL,12,FLilliput Road, in Northampton, in
OL,13,FNovember 2021 after a HGV driver
OL,14,Freported that his container had been
OL,15,Fbroken into and items were stolen.
OL,17,FPolice said bystanders had seen a group
OL,18,Fof men unload "large wrapped packages"
OL,19,Ffrom a lorry into a grey van. Within
OL,20,Ftwo hours officers recovered the van
OL,21,Fand found 11 holdalls in it.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
