OL,3,GNEWSATrio jailed after #80m of cocaine
OL,4,Asmuggled in lorry
OL,5,
OL,6,FCraig Le-Mare, 36, of no fixed address,
OL,7,Fhas been sentenced at the Old Bailey
OL,8,Ffor conspiracy to supply cocaine. Two
OL,9,Faccomplices had already been jailed for
OL,10,Fthe same offence.
